9999999999997},{"ratio":0.96,"watchRatio":0.43235},{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.4235},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.41125},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.39725},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.3913}],"script":{"source_path":"2026-10-naga-sadhus-dhalsim-gokul.md","words":107,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"Vidya Jumble, playing Dhalsim in the"},{"sec":1.9,"text":"Street Fighter is cool, but what if I"},{"sec":3.7,"text":"told you a whole army of Dhalsims once"},{"sec":6.2,"text":"stopped an Afghan invasion? Ahmad Shah"},{"sec":8.2,"text":"Durrani's forces sacked Mathura during"},{"sec":10.2,"text":"Holi and marched on the holy town of"},{"sec":12.1,"text":"Gokul, but the Naga Sadhus were waiting"},{"sec":14.1,"text":"for them. 4,000 armed warrior monks with"},{"sec":16.9,"text":"talwars, matchlocks, and tridents met"},{"sec":19.5,"text":"the Afghans head-on. The fighting was a"},{"sec":21.7,"text":"bloodbath with roughly 2,000 men dying"},{"sec":24,"text":"on each side in close-quarter combat,"},{"sec":26.2,"text":"but the resistance worked and the Afghan"},{"sec":28.3,"text":"column pulled back. So, while Dhalsim on"},{"sec":30.4,"text":"big screen is great, an actual army of"},{"sec":32.5,"text":"yogis stopping an empire is legendary."}],"text":""}}